# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from data/forever and tools/lib/professions/gathering. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/mining
title Mining 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# Mining 1-300 for both factions: loops through the densest skill-up nodes for
# each skill band (expected skill-ups per yard walked), with rank training.
# Skill needed per node: Copper 1, Tin and Incendicite 65, Silver and Lesser
# Bloodstone 75, Iron 125, Gold 155, Mithril 175, Truesilver and Dark Iron 230,
# Small Thorium 245, Rich Thorium 275.
#
# Spawns, trainers and vendors come from the Era baseline (pfQuest); recipes and
# their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`profession build`).
# Nothing confirms the spawns' 10-60 placement on Forever yet: refine with
# Polestar_Recorder sessions. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine
# converts them where Forever changed a map frame.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

step Learn Mining
  tip Any Mining trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Mining (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Mining Pick from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot mine without it.
  level 5
  train Mining Apprentice
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 1-65

